      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>A value for hyphenation calculation mode. This value indicates that hyphenation points are calculated with faster algorithm. This algorithm measures text width with ignoring the context of hyphen character shaping, e.g. kerning.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/text/MeasuredText.Builder#HYPHENATION_MODE_FAST" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.graphics.text.MeasuredText.Builder.HYPHENATION_MODE_FAST</code>.</a></format></para>
